   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Dwarf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You already felt the call of something greater than yourself, and that's the call of the elements. We dwarves have a strong connection to earth, but with the right training, you can learn to speak to all of the elements. The elementals can be demanding and challenging, but I'm here to guide you in learning how to communicate with them. Come find me in Anvilmar and I'll teach you how to listen to the elements, and how to get them to listen to you.\r\n\r\n- Teo Hammerstorm, $C Trainer",
   "time": 1793886161,
   "title": "Archaic Rune",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Dun Morogh"
  },
  "a62677dc": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warlock",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Gnome",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "ATTENTION:\n\nRemain Silent! Don't look around at anyone! Someone could be watching you this very moment.\n\nMy name is Alamar Grimm, HENWA. I train those willing to seek knowledge and greater power from... worlds beyond. I've been asked to get in touch with you discretely and inform you that I can train you further in a real form of magic.\n\nWhen you can, come find me in the back of Anvilmar.\n\n-Alamar Grimm, $C Trainer",
   "time": 1793857423,
   "title": "Tainted Memorandum",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Dun Morogh"
  }
 },
